00:01:10.513 --> 00:01:12.774
Up to this point, you still kind of consider her

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:15.520
"Sweet Sansa," sweet summer-child Sansa.

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.460
She's like one of those characters that totally

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:19.680
bought into the idea chivalry and the fantasy of

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:21.988
royal society, and then over the last 4 seasons

00:01:21.988 --> 00:01:24.740
 and the first 3 books, that fantasy slowly gets burned

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:25.720
