00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:38.376
Slowly along the way, her idea of reality

00:01:38.376 --> 00:01:39.780
just gets chipped away.

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:41.553
Where does that leave her in season 5?

00:01:41.553 --> 00:01:42.933
So, if you remember at the end of season 4,

00:01:42.933 --> 00:01:45.949
Little Finger convinced Sansa to decieve Lord Royce

00:01:45.949 --> 00:01:47.709
and the other nobles of the Vale after he

00:01:47.709 --> 00:01:49.460
sent Lysa through the Moon Door.

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:52.407
They always hated Little Finger, he's an imposter in their eyes.

00:01:52.407 --> 00:01:54.374
So, Sansa could have totally told the truth

00:01:54.374 --> 00:01:55.473
and hung him out to dry.

00:01:55.473 --> 00:01:56.953
I don't know if you could call telling a 

00:01:56.953 --> 00:01:59.033
bold-faced lie "courageous," but this is one of the 

00:01:59.033 --> 00:02:01.440
first times Sansa acted in her own interest,

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:02.993
even if it meant doing something bad.

00:02:02.993 --> 00:02:05.220
Doing bad things for the right reasons,

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:07.293
or doing bad things in your own self-interest,

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:09.474
that is what playing the Game of Thrones is all about.

00:02:09.474 --> 00:02:11.340
Whenever she was back in King's Landing I think

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:13.800
she mostly applied avoidance tactics, where she just

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:16.526
tried to blend in with the furniture hoping that Joffrey

00:02:16.526 --> 00:02:18.173
would see something shiny and distract him.

00:02:18.173 --> 00:02:20.639
Then you get to the end of season 4, and she's learning

00:02:20.639 --> 00:02:23.039
to manipulate people, with Little Finger's help.

00:02:23.039 --> 00:02:25.240
One of my favorite clever Sansa moments

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:27.753
from when this starts to happen, is when Little Finger

00:02:27.753 --> 00:02:30.106
visits her after that meeting with Lord Royce

00:02:30.106 --> 00:02:32.800
and she tells him, "I know what you want."

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:35.453
It's like her saying "I get it now, I understand what you're after."

00:02:35.453 --> 00:02:38.033
And then the next time we see her, she's dyed her hair

00:02:38.033 --> 00:02:40.682
black, and she's wearing this awesome looking black dress.

00:02:40.682 --> 00:02:42.214
So when you look at her in these shots

00:02:42.214 --> 00:02:44.639
from the season 5 trailer, you can see she's starting

00:02:44.639 --> 00:02:46.933
