00:03:19.194 --> 00:03:21.260
And the trailer even teases this a little.

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:22.933
Little Finger tells Sansa,

00:03:22.933 --> 00:03:26.393
"There's no justice in this world, not unless we make it."

00:03:26.393 --> 00:03:29.097
