00:03:38.846 --> 00:03:40.977
The only potential issues with this, are that

00:03:40.977 --> 00:03:43.821
Sansa's TV show story has already caught up with her book story.

00:03:43.821 --> 00:03:45.600
For those that haven't read the books,

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:48.553
Sansa's story in the books ends at the end of book 4,

00:03:48.553 --> 00:03:51.034
