00:03:51.034 --> 00:03:52.840
This is like the last scene that we get with her.

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:55.274
There was a chapter that Gerorge R. R. Martin wrote

00:03:55.274 --> 00:03:56.834
for Winds of Winter for her character,

00:03:56.834 --> 00:03:59.495
but because both of those books (books 4 and 5)

00:03:59.495 --> 00:04:01.980
